[00:00.000] 作词 : HoonBlues
[00:01.000] 作曲 : HoonBlues
[00:02.000] 编曲 : HoonBlues
[00:27.060]There is a tale upon the wind
[00:28.980]That rides the valley, knows no end
[00:34.140]Some saw a crimson gleam descend
[00:39.600]Before the morning light begins
[00:49.290]He climbs the ridge with blade in hand
[00:57.060]The jeweled edge a thunderous brand
[00:59.940]He hunts the stars to wear as strand
[01:04.710]Yet none shall know where he does stand
[01:08.370]A dragon’ s gaze within the glass
[01:09.090]The horn upon his brow, unmasked
[02:17.370]O hunter, tell me as you pass
[02:22.020]Are you the hunter or the last?
[02:22.740]The fire fades, the tale remains
[02:23.340]The old ones sing, the young ones chain
[02:27.630]The golden eyes and horn may wane
[02:33.150]But still the song knows no refrain
